# Surveillance Monitor: "Whenever you collect evidence" is its controller's evidence only. Bot1 casts the Monitor on turn 1; Bot2 casts Forensic Researcher
# and Entombs Counterspell on turn 2, then on turn 4 the Researcher collects evidence 3 (Entomb 1 and Counterspell 2) to tap Bot1's Monitor. Bot2 collected
# the evidence, not Bot1, so no Thopter is made for either player (CR 701.59a, 603.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Surveillance Monitor
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Forensic Researcher
Entomb
Island
Island
Island
Counterspell
Island x10

